{"ticker":"NET","updated":"2026-10-23T23:22:15Z","profile":{"longName":"Cloudflare, Inc.","shortName":"Cloudflare, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","country":"United States","website":"https://www.cloudflare.com","fullTimeEmployees":5156,"marketCap":115985850368,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":194.08794,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":46.16628,"pegRatio":2.38,"targetMeanPrice":343.41934,"targetHighPrice":430.0,"targetLowPrice":160.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":31,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.359,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.72577006,"operatingMargins":-0.07603,"profitMargins":-0.082100004,"totalRevenue":2512349952,"beta":1.645,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":370.35,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":158.83,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Cloudflare, Inc. operates as a cloud services provider that delivers a range of services to businesses worldwide. The company provides a cloud-based security solution to secure a range of combination of platforms, including public and private cloud, on-premises, software-as-a-service applications, and Internet of things (IoT) devices; and application security products comprising web application firewall, bot management, distributed denial of service mitigation, API security, SSL/TLS encryption, client-side security, and security center products. It also offers application performance solutions, such as content delivery, load balancing, DNS, smart shield, video stream delivery, web optimization, cloudfare waiting room, and cloudfare data localization suite; SASE platform that combines network services and Zero Trust and workplace security products that provides a cloud-based network and security-as-a-service; network services, including magic WAN, magic transit, magic firewall, cloudflare network interconnect, and spectrum. In addition, the company provides zero trust security services which include cloudflare zero trust network access, secure web gateway, and one client; and remote browser isolation, cloud access security broker, cloud email security, digital experience monitoring, and data loss prevention products. Further, it provides developer-based solutions comprising work","summary_zh":"Cloudflare, Inc. 作為雲端服務供應商經營，為全球企業提供一系列服務。該公司提供基於雲端的安全解決方案，以保護一系列平台組合的安全，包括公有雲和私有雲、本地、軟體即服務應用程式和物聯網 (IoT) 設備；應用安全產品，包括 Web 應用防火牆、機器人管理、分散式阻斷服務緩解、API 安全、SSL/TLS 加密、客戶端安全和安全中心產品。它還提供應用效能解決方案，例如內容交付、負載平衡、DNS、智慧盾、視訊串流交付、Web最佳化、cloudfare候診室和cloudfare資料在地化套件； SASE 平台結合了網路服務和零信任以及工作場所安全產品，提供基於雲端的網路和安全即服務；網路服務，包括 Magic WAN、Magic Transit、Magic Firewall、cloudware。此外，該公司還提供零信任安全服務，包括cloudflare零信任網路存取、安全Web網關和一個客戶端；遠端瀏覽器隔離、雲端存取安全代理、雲端電子郵件安全、數位體驗監控和資料遺失防護產品。此外，它還提供基於開發人員的解決方案，包括工作","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 基礎設施","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":196.5,"h":197.46,"l":194.13,"c":195.88,"v":1246500},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":196.4,"h":201.5,"l":195.94,"c":198.55,"v":2750300},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":201.4,"h":205.65,"l":199.76,"c":205.24,"v":2433600},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":205.8,"h":215.65,"l":205.8,"c":213.42,"v":2733100},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":212.48,"h":214.434,"l":206.0,"c":208.71,"v":2095100},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":202.65,"h":208.71,"l":199.39,"c":208.05,"v":1894000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":208.78,"h":208.971,"l":203.86,"c":205.71,"v":1382400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":204.99,"h":211.14,"l":200.67,"c":209.98,"v":1780000},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":212.11,"h":214.71,"l":208.46,"c":214.43,"v":1638300},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":216.7,"h":220.99,"l":216.23,"c":217.92,"v":2390300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":217.92,"h":219.2,"l":214.85,"c":218.56,"v":1671500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":219.97,"h":225.29,"l":219.51,"c":222.97,"v":2216000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":224.9,"h":230.1,"l":223.09,"c":224.64,"v":3132400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":223.8,"h":225.52,"l":220.43,"c":221.32,"v":1554100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":220.57,"h":229.54,"l":220.51,"c":226.01,"v":1878500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":225.0,"h":225.162,"l":218.39,"c":219.24,"v":2579600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":219.65,"h":220.19